{"reviewId": "221256531_86sWpFVyf", "review": {"abstract": "我们需要为手中的钱保值，所以一个办法就是买进一线城市核心区域的房地产。第二个办法是搞新兴产业，很多人投了新三板。我从心底里认为，这两个办法都是消灭中产阶层财富的方法。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterUid": 23, "content": "那时我即使读到这句话也不会信，看到的是别人在抢房子，房子一直在涨，一直涨到20年。牛人就是比普通人多看好几年，甚至在更高的一个维度看现象。透过现象能看到本质。而普通人被洪流裹挟着。\n人的认知独立是多么地困难，因为我们是群体中的一员，如果与周围人太格格不入，要么是神，要么就是疯子。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "3052-3135", "createTime": 1769494454, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "221256531_86sWpFVyf", "userVid": 221256531, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 221256531, "name": "日新", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0024-H0wIa3C1cUHj2teJ~F91Pa4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "日新", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "茶，书，乐。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "日拱一卒", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 30, "likes": [{"userVid": 11674, "name": "Leon", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEI9JRnpoaLbicyDicfRWEbwicgPNRtIEPvRibOZKliap4blbsWvdzv1rLtYoKYaBicyoBqGWpVIicWsyxviag/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "｡◕‿◕｡", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title"